  <div class="container jigger-form matrix-info">
    <h2>📊 What is the Popularity vs. Profitability Matrix?</h2>
    <p>The <strong>Popularity vs. Profitability Matrix</strong> helps you analyze your menu items based on <strong>sales performance and profitability</strong>. It categorizes each item into one of four groups:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>🌟 <strong>Stars</strong> – High sales & high profit (your best items)</li>
      <li>🚀 <strong>Plowhorses</strong> – High sales, low profit (optimize pricing or costs)</li>
      <li>📉 <strong>Puzzles</strong> – Low sales, high profit (improve marketing & visibility)</li>
      <li>💀 <strong>Dogs</strong> – Low sales, low profit (consider removing or reworking)</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Use this matrix to <strong>identify top performers, adjust pricing, and optimize your menu for maximum profitability.</strong></p>
  </div>
</div>

